# Root build context for the backend image (docker-compose backend: context: .).
# Needed: the backend module + the externalized capability modules (mcp-servers/*,
# provisioned separately but their go.mod resolves) + infra/scripts (the lint tools
# live OUTSIDE backend — make lint reaches ../infra/scripts). Everything else (app/,
# e2e/, docs/, .git, node_modules, other modules) bloats the context — exclude it
# all, then re-include just what the build needs.
*
!backend
!mcp-servers
# infra/scripts holds the lint tooling (shell checks + the check-no-nil-container Go
# module). Nested re-include: descend into infra, drop the rest, keep just scripts.
!infra
infra/*
!infra/scripts

# im-bridge 也用根 context（它要 @standmeet/sdk-core，那在 sdk/ 下，跳不出自己的目录）。
# 只挑源码和 pnpm 的三份清单进来 —— node_modules 由下面那条统一排掉，
# 所以后端那个 context 只多了几百 KB 的源码。
!im-bridge
!sdk
sdk/*
!sdk/packages
sdk/packages/*
!sdk/packages/core
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!package.json

# 依赖目录一律不进 context：镜像里自己装，带进去只会又大又不一致。
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

# Re-exclude noise inside the included trees (mirrors the old backend/.dockerignore).
# .git excluded → lint's gitleaks scans the tree, not history; history out of image.
**/.git/
**/.github/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.DS_Store
**/bin/
**/out/
**/*.swp
**/*~
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
